flowchart TD
  accTitle: Multilingual quality checks and fallback policy
  accDescr {
    Issue #99 adds production checks for translated NutsNews article cards. The goal is to keep multilingual cards useful without letting a missing or questionable translation break t…
  }
  A[Worker accepts article] --> B[Save article as translation_pending]
  B --> C[Build and run summary translations]
  C --> D[Save article_summaries rows]
  D --> E[Run translation quality checks]
  E -->|Critical issue| F[Mark translation unavailable]
  E -->|Pass or warning| G[Candidate row is publishable]
  F --> H[API keeps English fallback and logs diagnostics]
  G --> I[Publish guard validates all enabled languages]
  I -->|Missing rows| J[Return ok=false and missingTranslations]
  J --> K[Worker logs and retries recovery]
  K --> L[public_feed_snapshot refresh deferred]
  I -->|All rows present| M[Patch articles.status=published]
  M --> N[Refresh public_feed_snapshot]
  N --> O[Web /api/articles uses localized title/summary when valid]
  O --> P{Localized row missing/invalid?}
  P -->|Yes| H
  P -->|No| Q[Render localized card]
